      "observed": "On the EPD_Driver sheet, C1 (the boost-converter input decoupling capacitor tied between the Display_Power_Switch node and GND, in parallel with C2) is drawn with value 0.1uF/16V.",
      "expected": "The specification's component-matching table (section 4, directly sourced) assigns C1 to the PDI reference 'C2 default' group and states C1/C5/C7/C8/C9/C10 = 1 µF/25 V. C1 should therefore be 1 µF/25 V, not 0.1 µF/16 V.",
